#: ../../source/docs/code-overview-sensor-drivers.rst:5
#: 4b24b88ec4524695b8111c4666f99115
msgid "Sensor Drivers"
msgstr "传感器驱动"

#: ../../source/docs/code-overview-sensor-drivers.rst:7
#: aa162fe3957b467ea0744952b48479c9
msgid ""
"ArduPilot supports a wide variety of sensors from many different "
"manufacturers.  One clear example of this can be seen in the :ref:`list of "
"range finders <copter:common-rangefinder-landingpage>` (aka sonars, lidars)."
" This page attempts to explain how sensor drivers are written and integrated"
" into the vehicle code."
msgstr ""
"ArduPilot 支持来自众多不同制造商的各种传感器。:ref:`测距仪列表 <copter:common-rangefinder-"
"landingpage>`（如声纳、激光雷达）是一个典型示例。本页尝试说明传感器驱动的编写方式及其与飞行器代码的集成方法。"

#: ../../source/docs/code-overview-sensor-drivers.rst:11
#: 8b9a42792c624e3ea43ad4221eed5bc8
msgid "Supported Protocols"
msgstr "支持的协议"

#: ../../source/docs/code-overview-sensor-drivers.rst:13
#: 5aaddbf516fc4ae8ad5e039127582ec1
msgid ""
"`I2C <https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/I%C2%B2C>`__, `SPI "
"<https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Serial_Peripheral_Interface_Bus>`__, `UART "
"(aka Serial) "
"<https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Universal_asynchronous_receiver/transmitter>`__"
" and `CANBUS <https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/CAN_bus>`__ (in particular "
"UAVCAN/DroneCAN) protocols are supported."
msgstr ""
"支持 `I2C <https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/I%C2%B2C>`__、`SPI "
"<https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Serial_Peripheral_Interface_Bus>`__、`UART（即串行）<https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Universal_asynchronous_receiver/transmitter>`__"
" 和 `CANBUS <https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/CAN_bus>`__（尤其是 "
"UAVCAN/DroneCAN）协议。"

#: ../../source/docs/code-overview-sensor-drivers.rst:16
#: ea025d161369455ca5e56c7c4a00ff80
msgid ""
"If you plan to write a new driver, you will likely need to refer to the "
"sensor's datasheet in order to determine which protocol it uses. "
"Alternatively, you could utilize an intermediary node to move the necessary "
"data back to the autopilot."
msgstr "如果计划编写新驱动，可能需要参考传感器数据手册以确定其使用的协议。或者，也可以利用中间节点将必要数据传回自动驾驶仪。"

#: ../../source/docs/code-overview-sensor-drivers.rst:19
#: 1732a6645488497697981c1f1d7604b1
msgid "I2C"
msgstr "I2C"

#: ../../source/docs/code-overview-sensor-drivers.rst:21
#: 82d707b30d5c44ccb8b2da3a29d58dd9
msgid "one master, many slaves possible"
msgstr "一个主机，可连接多个从机"

#: ../../source/docs/code-overview-sensor-drivers.rst:22
#: be40f3f0c3db4666817630dc607d6af4
msgid ""
"a relatively simple protocol which is good for communicating over short-"
"distances (i.e. less than 1m)."
msgstr "相对简单的协议，适合短距离通信（即小于 1m）。"

#: ../../source/docs/code-overview-sensor-drivers.rst:23
#: 54ca74e9e9714c4b8bb8bfb0191b0444
msgid ""
"bus runs at 100kHz or 400kHz but the data rate is relatively low compared to"
" other protocols."
msgstr "总线运行在 100kHz 或 400kHz，但与其他协议相比数据率相对较低。"

#: ../../source/docs/code-overview-sensor-drivers.rst:24
#: 0d88be1513fe445a90cc1985903913e4
msgid "only 4 pins are required (VCC, GND, SDA, SCL)"
msgstr "仅需 4 根引脚（VCC、GND、SDA、SCL）"

#: ../../source/docs/code-overview-sensor-drivers.rst:30
#: 3a6f4e96a694407aadba894156762d9b
msgid "SPI"
msgstr "SPI"

#: ../../source/docs/code-overview-sensor-drivers.rst:32
#: ../../source/docs/code-overview-sensor-drivers.rst:43
#: 2b83737158e9411a861395f1be3f6cb2 af42377935324fee9e5c1b1f3305acdb
msgid "one master, one slave"
msgstr "一个主机，一个从机"

#: ../../source/docs/code-overview-sensor-drivers.rst:33
#: e61d2a43046a4b70b48c4f6328e5254a
msgid "20Mhz+ speed meaning it is very fast especially compared to I2C"
msgstr "速度 20MHz 以上，尤其比 I2C 快很多"

#: ../../source/docs/code-overview-sensor-drivers.rst:34
#: 5517cbd47ce241f09b1f62ef8a995c2e
msgid "only works over short distances (10cm)"
msgstr "仅适用于短距离（10cm）"

#: ../../source/docs/code-overview-sensor-drivers.rst:35
#: 73a0aba1360d47d4855c077a72da400e
msgid ""
"requires at least 5 pins (VCC, GND, SCLK, Master-Out-Slave-In, Master-In-"
"Slave-Out) + 1 slave select pin per slave"
msgstr "至少需要 5 根引脚（VCC、GND、SCLK、主出从入、主入从出），每个从机额外需要 1 根片选引脚"

#: ../../source/docs/code-overview-sensor-drivers.rst:41
#: 65b37f68b9564e3b9a9255f56f945217
msgid "Serial / UART"
msgstr "串行 / UART"

#: ../../source/docs/code-overview-sensor-drivers.rst:44
#: be7b0cc46e4c46a8b3f3c44028e8c88a
msgid ""
"character based protocol good for communicating over longer distances "
"compared to I2C and SPI (i.e. 1m)"
msgstr "基于字符的协议，适合比 I2C 和 SPI 更长距离的通信（即 1m）"

#: ../../source/docs/code-overview-sensor-drivers.rst:45
#: 01109718886b4d598f240c69ec9e99eb
msgid "relatively fast at 57Kbps ~ 1.5Mbps"
msgstr "速度相对较快，57Kbps 至 1.5Mbps"

#: ../../source/docs/code-overview-sensor-drivers.rst:46
#: f1ea2566238240d9ab0b58634dcee8d0
msgid ""
"at least 4 pins required (VCC, GND, TX, RX), plus 2 optional pins (Clear-To-"
"Send, Clear-To-Receive)"
msgstr "至少需要 4 根引脚（VCC、GND、TX、RX），另有 2 根可选引脚（CTS、CTS）"

#: ../../source/docs/code-overview-sensor-drivers.rst:49
#: a5a112c12c62445aa763752fa2e923a7
msgid "CAN bus with UAVCAN"
msgstr "带 UAVCAN 的 CAN 总线"

#: ../../source/docs/code-overview-sensor-drivers.rst:51
#: 101427aefb7c47299459135994d8033f
msgid ""
"multimaster bus, any node can initiate transmission of data when they need "
"to"
msgstr "多主总线，任意节点可在需要时发起数据传输"

#: ../../source/docs/code-overview-sensor-drivers.rst:52
#: 83181629620842549c9c5dabe2981ed3
msgid "packet based protocol for very long distances"
msgstr "基于数据包的协议，适合超长距离"

#: ../../source/docs/code-overview-sensor-drivers.rst:53
#: 9e3a015d0541433fbea5497b71a56eee
#, python-format
msgid ""
"high speed, typically 1 Mb (however only 50% of the bus bitrate can really "
"be used without major collisions)"
msgstr "高速，通常 1Mb（但总线位速率中实际只能使用约 50%，否则会发生大量冲突）"

#: ../../source/docs/code-overview-sensor-drivers.rst:54
#: 8c97ee0e7be04796b69afa9b8b64cfe9
msgid ""
"at least 3 pins required (GND, CAN HI, CAN LO). Optionally VCC can be used "
"to power nodes"
msgstr "至少需要 3 根引脚（GND、CAN HI、CAN LO）。可选使用 VCC 为节点供电"

#: ../../source/docs/code-overview-sensor-drivers.rst:55
#: dc916d82c5fd4e1c8104b0cf9c6dbeb1
msgid "point-to-point topology. Star or stubs topolgy is not advised"
msgstr "点对点拓扑。不建议使用星形或分支拓扑"

#: ../../source/docs/code-overview-sensor-drivers.rst:56
#: 4fcf4f3f601b48b7917a08b7a3d643b8
msgid "termination is required at each end of the bus"
msgstr "总线两端各需要一个终端电阻"

#: ../../source/docs/code-overview-sensor-drivers.rst:61
#: ef89ae2a8eab4757bb871bb591dca6df
msgid "FrontEnd / BackEnd Split"
msgstr "前端 / 后端分层"

#: ../../source/docs/code-overview-sensor-drivers.rst:63
#: ea28643c768e42369bb3f33f0a2260b0
msgid ""
"An important concept within the sensor driver architecture is the front-end "
"/ back-end split."
msgstr "传感器驱动架构中的一个重要概念是前端 / 后端分层。"

#: ../../source/docs/code-overview-sensor-drivers.rst:67
#: ec4d13d9835c4227950ac44fc28a83b4
msgid ""
"The vehicle code only ever calls into the Library's (aka sensor driver's) "
"front-end."
msgstr "飞行器代码只调用库（即传感器驱动）的前端。"

#: ../../source/docs/code-overview-sensor-drivers.rst:69
#: 2b5930d39af84e38bbe30783749fdbac
msgid ""
"On start-up the front-end creates one or more back-ends based either on "
"automatic detection of the sensor (i.e. probing for a response on a known "
"I2C address) or by using the user defined _TYPE params (i.e. RNGFND_TYPE, "
"RNGFND_TYPE2).  The front-end maintains pointers to each back-end which are "
"normally held within an array named _drivers[]."
msgstr ""
"启动时，前端根据传感器自动检测（即在已知 I2C 地址上探测响应）或用户定义的 _TYPE 参数（如 "
"RNGFND_TYPE、RNGFND_TYPE2）创建一个或多个后端。前端通过指针维护各后端，通常存放在名为 _drivers[] 的数组中。"

#: ../../source/docs/code-overview-sensor-drivers.rst:72
#: 4e2cdd04f18542ea831f54f63557d434
msgid "User settable parameters are always held within the front-end."
msgstr "用户可设置的参数始终保存在前端。"

#: ../../source/docs/code-overview-sensor-drivers.rst:75
#: f5c6e243d2a04cbd91bd32c2e43046df
msgid "How and When the driver code is run"
msgstr "驱动代码的运行方式与时机"

#: ../../source/docs/code-overview-sensor-drivers.rst:79
#: f0880cda838a455e989e483936e84e51
msgid ""
"The image above shows a zoomed in view of the ardupilot architecture.  The "
"top-left blue box illustrates how the sensor driver's back-ends are run in a"
" background thread. Raw data from the sensors is collected, converted into "
"standard units and then held within buffers within the driver."
msgstr ""
"上图展示了 ArduPilot "
"架构的放大视图。左上角蓝色框说明传感器驱动的后端在后台线程中运行。来自传感器的原始数据被收集、转换为标准单位，然后存储在驱动内的缓冲区中。"

#: ../../source/docs/code-overview-sensor-drivers.rst:82
#: 2005de5fb3a34e57baebd2c003d42124
msgid ""
"The vehicle code's main thread runs regularly (i.e. 400hz for copter) and "
"accesses the latest data available through methods in the driver's front-"
"end. For example in order to calculate the latest attitude estimate, the "
"AHRS/EKF would pull the latest accelerometer, gyro and compass information "
"from the sensor drivers' front-ends."
msgstr ""
"飞行器代码的主线程定期运行（如 Copter 为 400Hz），通过驱动前端的方法访问最新数据。例如，AHRS/EKF "
"会从传感器驱动前端获取最新的加速度计、陀螺仪和罗盘信息，以计算最新的姿态估计。"

#: ../../source/docs/code-overview-sensor-drivers.rst:85
#: 4db511be2d474f6a91a621e52f4d32f9
msgid ""
"The image is a slight generalization, for drivers using I2C or SPI, they "
"must run in the background thread so that the highrate communication with "
"the sensor does not affect the main loop's performance but for driver's "
"using a serial (aka UART) interface, it is safe to run in the main thread "
"because the underlying serial driver itself collects data in the background "
"and includes a buffer."
msgstr ""
"上图存在一定的概括性简化：对于使用 I2C 或 SPI 的驱动，必须在后台线程中运行，以避免与传感器的高频通信影响主循环性能；而对于使用串行（即 "
"UART）接口的驱动，则可以安全地在主线程中运行，因为底层串行驱动本身在后台收集数据并包含缓冲区。"

#: ../../source/docs/code-overview-sensor-drivers.rst:90
#: 89326bc7a14b4eb2991abd247d8c839e
msgid "Vehicle Code and Front-End Example"
msgstr "飞行器代码与前端示例"

#: ../../source/docs/code-overview-sensor-drivers.rst:92
#: c34767df249c4788a2d9d16ee3dd8ac0
msgid ""
"The example below shows how the Copter vehicle code pulls data from range "
"finder (aka sonar, lidar) drivers. The Copter code's `scheduler "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/blob/master/ArduCopter/Copter.cpp#L107>`__"
" calls the vehicle's read_rangefinder() method at 20Hz. Below is a picture "
"of this method, the latest version can be seen in the `sensors.cpp "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/blob/master/ArduCopter/sensors.cpp>`__"
" file. The rangefinder.update() method is a call into the driver's front-"
"end."
msgstr ""
"以下示例展示了 Copter 飞行器代码如何从测距仪（如声纳、激光雷达）驱动中获取数据。Copter 代码的 `调度器 "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/blob/master/ArduCopter/Copter.cpp#L107>`__"
" 以 20Hz 调用飞行器的 read_rangefinder() 方法。该方法可在 `sensors.cpp "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/blob/master/ArduCopter/sensors.cpp>`__"
" 文件中查看。rangefinder.update() 方法是对驱动前端的调用。"

#: ../../source/docs/code-overview-sensor-drivers.rst:99
#: 51f83c2fb35a477695b3976b8a192da1
msgid ""
"Below is the range finder driver's front-end `update method "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/blob/master/libraries/AP_RangeFinder/AP_RangeFinder.cpp#L289>`__."
" This gives the driver a chance to do any general processing it might want "
"to within the main thread. Each back-end's update method is called in turn."
msgstr ""
"以下是测距仪驱动前端的 `update 方法 "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/blob/master/libraries/AP_RangeFinder/AP_RangeFinder.cpp#L289>`__。这为驱动提供了在主线程中进行通用处理的机会。各后端的"
" update 方法会依次被调用。"

#: ../../source/docs/code-overview-sensor-drivers.rst:106
#: 810ca530e33b46dbbdd5230e63cfae1d
msgid "UART/Serial Back-End Example"
msgstr "UART/串行后端示例"

#: ../../source/docs/code-overview-sensor-drivers.rst:108
#: 52e6ff47408741db89f62fc4a245ceb6
msgid ""
"Next is the update method of the `LightWare back-end "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/blob/master/libraries/AP_RangeFinder/AP_RangeFinder_LightWareSerial.cpp>`__"
" using the serial protocol. As described on the `user wiki "
"<https://ardupilot.org/copter/docs/common-lightware-sf10-lidar.html#serial-"
"connection>`__ the serial range finder can be connected to any of the flight"
" controller's serial ports but the user must specify which serial port, and "
"what baud rate is used by setting the SERIALX_BAUD and SERIALX_PROTOCOL "
"parameters."
msgstr ""
"以下是使用串行协议的 `LightWare 后端 "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/blob/master/libraries/AP_RangeFinder/AP_RangeFinder_LightWareSerial.cpp>`__"
" 的 update 方法。如 `用户 wiki <https://ardupilot.org/copter/docs/common-lightware-"
"sf10-lidar.html#serial-connection>`__ 所述，串行测距仪可连接到飞控的任意串口，但用户必须通过设置 "
"SERIALX_BAUD 和 SERIALX_PROTOCOL 参数指定使用哪个串口及波特率。"

#: ../../source/docs/code-overview-sensor-drivers.rst:113
#: 448dc151ff9c415e803106532b9d5e10
msgid ""
"Within the serial driver's `backend code "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/blob/master/libraries/AP_RangeFinder/AP_RangeFinder_Backend_Serial.cpp>`__,"
" it first finds which UART the user would like to use via the serial_manager"
" class which looks for the parameters settings described above."
msgstr ""
"在串行驱动的 `后端代码 "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/blob/master/libraries/AP_RangeFinder/AP_RangeFinder_Backend_Serial.cpp>`__"
" 中，首先通过 serial_manager 类查找用户希望使用的 UART，该类会查找上述参数设置。"

#: ../../source/docs/code-overview-sensor-drivers.rst:117
#: 5774779f2067465cbd2fbe0fb99b1885
msgid ""
"Each time the driver's back-end update() method is called it calls the "
"get_reading method which checks if new characters have arrived from the "
"sensor and then decodes them."
msgstr "每次调用驱动后端的 update() 方法时，它都会调用 get_reading 方法，检查是否有来自传感器的新字符到达并对其进行解码。"

#: ../../source/docs/code-overview-sensor-drivers.rst:119
#: c34a9f204d964bb981bfee92cd2151b1
msgid ""
"As mentioned above, because the serial protocol implements its own "
"buffering, the processing of any data (see get_reading method) from the "
"sensor is run here in the main thread. I.e. there is no "
"\"register_periodic_callback\" like you will see in I2C and SPI drivers."
msgstr ""
"如上所述，由于串行协议本身实现了缓冲，来自传感器的数据处理（见 get_reading 方法）在主线程中运行。即不存在 I2C 和 SPI "
"驱动中常见的「register_periodic_callback」。"

#: ../../source/docs/code-overview-sensor-drivers.rst:126
#: d6f38aa85aee48d485c4bcd9561851b2
msgid "I2C Back-End Example"
msgstr "I2C 后端示例"

#: ../../source/docs/code-overview-sensor-drivers.rst:128
#: e61fb1f7b0c849e29b34bfba78271284
msgid ""
"This example shows the back-end for the Lightware I2C driver. In this case, "
"the front-end gets the I2C bus and passes it to the back-end during "
"initialisation."
msgstr "本示例展示了 Lightware I2C 驱动的后端。在此情况下，前端在初始化时获取 I2C 总线并将其传递给后端。"

#: ../../source/docs/code-overview-sensor-drivers.rst:133
#: 1f49918575064a54a09d5f3571236d04
msgid ""
"The back-end's init method then registers its \"timer\" method to be called "
"at 20hz.  Within the timer method (not shown) the get_reading() method is "
"called which reads bytes from the sensor and converts the distance to "
"centimeters."
msgstr ""
"后端的 init 方法随后将其「timer」方法注册为以 20Hz 被调用。在 timer 方法中（未显示），get_reading() "
"方法会被调用，从传感器读取字节并将距离转换为厘米。"

#: ../../source/docs/code-overview-sensor-drivers.rst:136
#: 8e2311d0e39242c79ea3740d9ee4e596
msgid "SPI Back-End Example"
msgstr "SPI 后端示例"

#: ../../source/docs/code-overview-sensor-drivers.rst:138
#: bc16d970e83841b883e8363f25cb8b82
msgid ""
"This example shows the back-end for the MPU9250 IMU which includes a gyro, "
"accelerometer and compass. The front-end gets the SPI bus and passes it to "
"the back-end during initialisation."
msgstr "本示例展示了 MPU9250 IMU（包含陀螺仪、加速度计和罗盘）的后端。前端在初始化时获取 SPI 总线并将其传递给后端。"

#: ../../source/docs/code-overview-sensor-drivers.rst:143
#: 8e1232d5955341eb81d67526866d59cf
msgid ""
"the start() method is called during initialisation and configures the "
"sensor. It uses semaphores to ensure no interference with other SPI devices "
"on the same bus."
msgstr "start() 方法在初始化期间被调用，并对传感器进行配置。它使用信号量确保与同一总线上其他 SPI 设备之间不发生干扰。"

#: ../../source/docs/code-overview-sensor-drivers.rst:146
#: fe7cd20c60114daeb97217ecef0e5a34
msgid ""
"The _read_sample method is registered so that it is called at 1000hz.  Note "
"there is no need to take/give semaphores within the _read_sample method "
"because that is done as part of the periodic callback code."
msgstr ""
"_read_sample 方法已被注册为以 1000Hz 调用。注意，无需在 _read_sample "
"方法内加锁/解锁信号量，因为这已作为周期性回调代码的一部分处理。"

#: ../../source/docs/code-overview-sensor-drivers.rst:148
#: 1616200228b341158c2ef5ace1e249c2
msgid ""
"the _block_read method shows how data can be read from the sensor's "
"registers."
msgstr "_block_read 方法展示了如何从传感器寄存器读取数据。"

#: ../../source/docs/code-overview-sensor-drivers.rst:153
#: 75e818f54ee74053a5c5a186134bdc30
msgid "Additional Advice"
msgstr "补充建议"

#: ../../source/docs/code-overview-sensor-drivers.rst:155
#: 7ef2c4ed0b83492a8773ee84801a2bf0
msgid ""
"When writing a sensor driver, never include any wait or sleep code because "
"this will either delay the main thread or the background thread associated "
"with the bus being used."
msgstr "编写传感器驱动时，切勿加入任何等待或睡眠代码，否则会导致主线程或与所用总线关联的后台线程延迟。"

#: ../../source/docs/code-overview-sensor-drivers.rst:157
#: 29e59ef44ee14e37bfe57c3ff97aae75
msgid ""
"If a new library is written, it must be added to the wscript file in the "
"vehicle directory (i.e. /ardupilot/ArduCopter/wscript) in order for it to be"
" linked into the final binary"
msgstr ""
